msgctxt "168"
msgid "Excuse me... Have you seen a white cat around here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "A cat? Probably, why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I'm so sorry to bother you, but... I'm looking for my cat. She's white, and "
"her name is Lasagna."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid ""
"A white cat... No, I can't say that I've seen a cat like that around here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Oh, no... She's been missing since yesterday. Where did she run off to..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"I have kind of a strange favor to ask of you, but... if you happen to see "
"Lasagna, do you think you could catch her for me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"She's white with a black splotch on her back that looks like Italy. You'll "
"know the moment you see her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "You mean like the country? Sure thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"I'll give you a reward if you can bring her back to me. Please, help me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Oh, it's you again. Have you had any luck? Did you find Lasagna?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "Non ancora."

msgctxt "300"
msgid "I... I don't know what I'll do without her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
